{"kind": "mod", "id": 2431, "name": "FPV Drone Mod", "slug": "fpv-drone-mod", "teaser": "Adds controllable kamikaze and reconnaissance drones to Tarkov", "owner_name": "pein", "downloads": 24829, "favourites": 56, "featured": true, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.pein.fpvdronemod", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Weapons", "category_id": 13, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:16:05.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:18:15.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-11-08T17:33:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "0.7.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<h3>Introduction</h3>\n<p>This mod adds a controllable FPV Kamikaze Drone to Tarkov.</p>\n<p>The FPV drone, required controller and headset are available from Skier. Better payloads become available at higher trader levels. The <code>\"Sova\" night vision module</code> can be bought from Mechanic, while the <code>Iridium thermal vision module</code> can be used for thermal vision.</p>\n<p>This mod is extremely experimental, please report issues and provide logs if possible.</p>\n<p>Project board: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/users/peinwastaken/projects/3/views/2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/users/peinwastaken/projects/3/views/2</a></p>\n<h3>Controls</h3>\n<p>The general control scheme looks something like this:</p>\n<p>General:</p>\n<pre><code>Show list of active drones (with Radio Controller): RightMouse\nStart piloting (with Radio Controller): LeftMouse\n</code></pre>\n<p>Keyboard (Drone):</p>\n<pre><code>Apply throttle - W\nYaw left/right - A/D\nPitch up/down - UpArrow/DownArrow\nRoll clockwise/counter-clockwise - RightArrow/LeftArrow\nToggle armed - K\nExit drone view - Backspace\n</code></pre>\n<p>Controller (Drone):</p>\n<pre><code>Left stick up - Throttle\nLeft stick left/right - Yaw\nRight stick up/down - Pitch\nRight stick left/right - Roll\nToggle armed - Y\nExit drone - B\n</code></pre>\n<p>Controls for keyboard and mouse can be changed in F12 for both the FPV and Recon drones. The mod also supports XInput, which means it has controller support.</p>\n<h3>Preview</h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"YcEyXVpGT1Y\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/YcEyXVpGT1Y?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YcEyXVpGT1Y/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Drag and drop.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"wByb5Ln.gif\" /></a></p>\n<h3>Thanks</h3>\n<p>Massive thank you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GrooveypenguinX - for helping with some technical questions, without which this mod wouldn’t have been possible</li>\n<li>Tron - for creating the controller and headset containers</li>\n<li>Eco and Pigeon - for sourcing the assets</li>\n<li>tarkin - for sending the BTR model which saved me 700 years of work</li>\n<li>TacticalToaster - helping with BigBrain</li>\n<li>Dar’Zhar, TheManWhoSoldTheWorld for sending me clips to use for the preview… which I didn’t end up using… whatever. Thanks anyway!</li>\n<li>Anyone else I may have forgotten, sorry…</li>\n<li>You for checking out the mod</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Known Issues</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Drones are amphibious</li>\n<li>Could be a NullReferenceException hiding somewhere, let me know if you find any.</li>\n</ul>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 17464467, "downloads": 567, "published_at": "2025-11-08T16:40:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2431/fpv-drone-mod/0.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "incompatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "0.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 17543654, "downloads": 2424, "published_at": "2025-11-09T12:57:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2431/fpv-drone-mod/0.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "incompatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "0.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 17578326, "downloads": 3074, "published_at": "2025-11-24T13:17:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2431/fpv-drone-mod/0.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "incompatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 902, "name": "BigBrain", "slug": "bigbrain"}, {"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "0.3.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 17578338, "downloads": 2536, "published_at": "2025-12-20T02:06:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2431/fpv-drone-mod/0.3.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "incompatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 902, "name": "BigBrain", "slug": "bigbrain"}, {"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "0.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 20986324, "downloads": 900, "published_at": "2026-01-12T13:29:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2431/fpv-drone-mod/0.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "incompatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 902, "name": "BigBrain", "slug": "bigbrain"}, {"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}, {"version": "0.5.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 55184818,